#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: eg-social-timeline.php eg-social-timeline.php:52 eg-social-timeline.php:53
msgid "EG Social Timeline"
msgstr "EG Social Timeline"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: eg-social-timeline.php
